  "description": "BaiqiSoft Barcode Label Printing SDK for .NET allows you to integrate the barcode label design and printing functionality into your .NET applications with a few steps. You can  use the  user-friendly  interfaces to design the label templates or create the label layouts yourself in C#  or VB.NET. All labels and forms are printed immediately  with data  supplied  by your application.\n\nDemo project with source code is available at http://www.mysofttool.com/net-print-barcode-label-control\nOnline documentation is available at https://www.mysofttool.com/help/labeldesign/\n\n1D Linear Barcodes: EAN-13, EAN-8, JAN-13, JAN-8, Code 39, Code 39 Extended, Code 93, Code 93 Extended, Code 128 Auto, Code 128A, Code 128B, Code 128C, Code 11, Codabar, UPC-A, UPC-E, Standard 2 of 5, Interleaved 2 of 5, UCC/EAN-128, GS1-128, ITF-14, ISBN/ISMN/ISSN, Industrial 2 of 5, MSI/Plessey, Telepen, Postnet, Pharmacode, UCC/EAN-14, SSCC-18.\n2D Barcodes: Aztec, Data Matrix, PDF 417, QRCode, GS1 DataMatrix, GS1 QRCode, Micro QRCode and Micro PDF417.\n\nFor more details, please visit http://www.mysofttool.com/net-print-barcode-label-control",
